---

<section id="ai" class="border-b border-hairline bg-ink px-6 py-24 text-paper md:px-10 md:py-40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
    <p class="mb-6 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">
      Permission-aware AI
    </p>
    <h2 class="max-w-5xl font-sans text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
      The only AI <span class="text-paper/50">that asks who&rsquo;s asking.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-paper/70 md:text-xl">
      Every tool call the agent makes is gated through the same permission system as the
      asking user. It cannot read what they cannot read. It cannot leak across teams.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-paper/15 bg-paper/15 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="bg-ink p-8 md:p-10">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Per-user</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-sans text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Honors your access mode</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-paper/70">
          Every read goes through the same checker as the UI &mdash;
          <span class="font-mono text-paper">OWNER_ONLY</span>,
          <span class="font-mono text-paper">EXPLICIT_MEMBERS</span>,
          <span class="font-mono text-paper">OPEN_TO_ORG</span>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-ink p-8 md:p-10">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Sandboxed</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-sans text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Egress workers, not cloud LLMs</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-paper/70">
          Outbound calls run in isolated workers. No silent shipping of your workspace
          to a third-party model behind your back.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-ink p-8 md:p-10">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Cited</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-sans text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Answers cite your work</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-paper/70">
          Every response links back to the notes, files, and messages it pulled from.
          Auditable, not magical.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl border border-paper/15 bg-paper/[0.04] p-6 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/80 md:p-8">
      <span class="text-paper/40">// Notion Custom Agents bypass asker permissions.</span><br />
      <span class="text-paper/40">// ClickUp Brain, Monday agents, Airtable Omni — same.</span><br />
      <span class="text-paper">Uniffy is the only workspace where the agent is bound by your role.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
